  "2026-10-12T14:19:41.770Z",pi-glm-tooling,"Scope: package tooling only. Copied pm-review gate scripts already match the reference worktree byte-for-byte (coverage/docstring/duplication/identity/lint/main-invocation/verify-release-publish-attestation), so no script changes were needed. package.json coverageGate.sources widened from src+index.ts to the full authored scope src, scripts, index.ts, eslint.config.ts with 100/100/100/100 thresholds and no ignore list; the gate additionally auto-requires index.ts and reconciles a fresh walk against the c8 report."
  "2026-10-12T14:19:42.291Z",pi-glm-tooling,"Authored test/tooling.test.ts (35 tests): identity-gate fixtures with real git repositories (unapproved authors/committers, added home paths, side branches, fail-closed policy), coverage-gate fixture projects covering every refusal and success path incl. main wiring, docstring-gate in-process and main runs, entry-point guard branches, publish-attestation verifier both entry answers, lint/duplication launchers as real child runs, manifest scope assertions, type-only src/types.ts load, release-workflow tracking link and gitignore fence. Standalone run: 35/35 pass."
